monospace,monospace;\">{{PD-USGov-DOJ}}</span></a>, <a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Template:PD-USGov-DEA\" title=\"Template:PD-USGov-DEA\"><span style=\"font-family:monospace,monospace;\">{{PD-USGov-DEA}}</span></a>, <a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Template:PD-USGov-FBI\" title=\"Template:PD-USGov-FBI\"><span style=\"font-family:monospace,monospace;\">{{PD-USGov-FBI}}</span></a>, <a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Template:PD-USGov-DHS\" title=\"Template:PD-USGov-DHS\"><span style=\"font-family:monospace,monospace;\">{{PD-USGov-DHS}}</span></a>, <a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Template:PD-USGov-DHS-CBP\" title=\"Template:PD-USGov-DHS-CBP\"><span style=\"font-family:monospace,monospace;\">{{PD-USGov-DHS-CBP}}</span></a> or <a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Template:PD-USGov-DHS-ICE\" title=\"Template:PD-USGov-DHS-ICE\"><span style=\"font-family:monospace,monospace;\">{{PD-USGov-DHS-ICE}}</span></a> instead</li>\n<li>Please note that not all federal law enforcement agencies mandates the use of bodycams while others only use them sparingly or inconsistently</li></ul></div>\n</div></div>\n<hr>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:small;line-height:1.4\" class=\"plainlinks noprint\"><a class=\"external text\" data-mw-original-href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Template:PD-automated/ar\" href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Template:PD-automated/ar\"><bdi class=\"language lang-ar\" lang=\"ar\">العربية</bdi></a> <b>∙</b> <a class=\"external text\" data-mw-original-href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Template:PD-automated/en\" href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Template:PD-automated/en\"><bdi class=\"language lang-en\" lang=\"en\">English</bdi></a> <b>∙</b> <a class=\"external text\" data-mw-original-href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Template:PD-automated/es\" href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Template:PD-automated/es\"><bdi class=\"language lang-es\" lang=\"es\">español</bdi></a> <b>∙</b> <a class=\"external text\" data-mw-origi